"камнях\" при использовании API libguestfs."

#. type: =head2
#: docs/guestfs-faq.pod:134
msgid "\"Could not allocate dynamic translator buffer\""
msgstr "\"Could not allocate dynamic translator buffer\""

#. type: textblock
#: docs/guestfs-faq.pod:136
