"\n"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/guestfs-release-notes-1.18.pod:146
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" - multiple gcc warnings and Coverity bugs have been fixed;  many\n"
"   strict-overflow bugs have also been fixed\n"
