" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_flag (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_flag (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2575
msgid "Add a command line flag which has no argument. eg:"
msgstr "Добавляет флаг командной строки, у которого нет аргумента. Например:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2577
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" qemuopts_add_flag (qopts, \"-no-user-config\");\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" qemuopts_add_flag (qopts, \"-no-user-config\");\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2579 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2593
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2608 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2649
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2666 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2675
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2689 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2703
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2731 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2773
msgid "Returns C<0> on success.  Returns C<-1> on error, setting C<errno>."
msgstr ""
"Возвращает C<0> при успехе.  Возвращает C<-1> при ошибке, устанавливая "
"C<errno>."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2581
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2583
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag, const char *value)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag, const char *value)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2586
msgid "Add a command line flag which has a single argument. eg:"
msgstr ""
"Добавляет флаг командной строки, у которого есть один аргумент. Например:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2588
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" qemuopts_add_arg (qopts, \"-m\", \"1024\");\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" qemuopts_add_arg (qopts, \"-m\", \"1024\");\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2590 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2605
msgid ""
"Don't use this if the argument is a comma-separated list, since quoting will "
"not be done properly.  See C<qemuopts_add_arg_list>."
msgstr ""
"Не используйте это, если аргумент представляет собой список, разделённый "
"запятыми, так как экранирование не будет выполнено правильно.  Смотрите "
"C<qemuopts_add_arg_list>."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2595
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg_format>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg_format>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2597
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg_format (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag,\n"
"                          const char *fs, ...)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg_format (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag,\n"
"                          const char *fs, ...)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2601
msgid "Add a command line flag which has a single formatted argument. eg:"
msgstr ""
"Добавляет флаг командной строки, у которого есть один отформатированный "
"аргумент. Например:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2603
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" qemuopts_add_arg_format (qopts, \"-m\", \"%d\", 1024);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" qemuopts_add_arg_format (qopts, \"-m\", \"%d\", 1024);\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2610
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg_noquote>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg_noquote>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2612
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg_noquote (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag,\n"
"                           const char *value)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg_noquote (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag,\n"
"                           const char *value)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2616
msgid ""
"This is like C<qemuopts_add_arg> except that no quoting is done on the value."
msgstr ""
"Это как C<qemuopts_add_arg>, за исключением того, что для значения не "
"выполняется экранирование."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2619
msgid ""
"For C<qemuopts_to_script> and C<qemuopts_to_channel>, this means that "
"neither shell quoting nor qemu comma quoting is done on the value."
msgstr ""
"Для C<qemuopts_to_script> и C<qemuopts_to_channel> это означает, что для "
"значения не выполняется ни экранирование оболочки, ни экранирование запятых "
"qemu."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2623
msgid "For C<qemuopts_to_argv> this means that qemu comma quoting is not done."
msgstr ""
"Для C<qemuopts_to_argv> это означает, что экранирование запятых qemu не "
"выполняется."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2626
msgid "C<qemuopts_to_config*> will fail."
msgstr "C<qemuopts_to_config*> завершится ошибкой."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2628
msgid "You should use this with great care."
msgstr "Используйте это с большой осторожностью."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2630
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_start_arg_list>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_start_arg_list>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2632
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_start_arg_list (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_start_arg_list (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2635
msgid "Start an argument that takes a comma-separated list of fields."
msgstr ""
"Начинает аргумент, который принимает разделённый запятыми список полей."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2637
msgid "Typical usage is like this (with error handling omitted):"
msgstr "Типичное использование выглядит так (обработка ошибок опущена):"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2639
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" qemuopts_start_arg_list (qopts, \"-drive\");\n"
" qemuopts_append_arg_list (qopts, \"file=foo\");\n"
" qemuopts_append_arg_list_format (qopts, \"if=%s\", \"ide\");\n"
" qemuopts_end_arg_list (qopts);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" qemuopts_start_arg_list (qopts, \"-drive\");\n"
" qemuopts_append_arg_list (qopts, \"file=foo\");\n"
" qemuopts_append_arg_list_format (qopts, \"if=%s\", \"ide\");\n"
" qemuopts_end_arg_list (qopts);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2644
msgid "which would construct C<-drive file=foo,if=ide>"
msgstr "что создаст C<-drive file=foo,if=ide>"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2646
msgid ""
"See also C<qemuopts_add_arg_list> for a way to do simple cases in one call."
msgstr ""
"Смотрите также C<qemuopts_add_arg_list> для способа выполнения простых "
"случаев за один вызов."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2651
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg_list>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_add_arg_list>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2653
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg_list (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag,\n"
"                        const char *elem0, ...)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_add_arg_list (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *flag,\n"
"                        const char *elem0, ...)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2657
msgid "Add a command line flag which has a list of arguments. eg:"
msgstr ""
"Добавляет флаг командной строки, у которого есть список аргументов. Например:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2659
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" qemuopts_add_arg_list (qopts, \"-drive\", \"file=foo\", \"if=ide\", NULL);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" qemuopts_add_arg_list (qopts, \"-drive\", \"file=foo\", \"if=ide\", NULL);\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2661
msgid ""
"This is turned into a comma-separated list, like: C<-drive "
"file=foo,if=ide>.  Note that this handles qemu quoting properly, so "
"individual elements may contain commas and this will do the right thing."
msgstr ""
"Это преобразуется в список, разделённый запятыми, например: C<-drive "
"file=foo,if=ide>.  Обратите внимание, что это правильно обрабатывает "
"экранирование qemu, поэтому отдельные элементы могут содержать запятые, и "
"это будет работать правильно."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2668
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_set_binary>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_set_binary>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2670
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_set_binary (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *binary)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_set_binary (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *binary)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2673
msgid "Set the qemu binary name."
msgstr "Устанавливает имя исполняемого файла qemu."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2677
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_set_binary_by_arch>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_set_binary_by_arch>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2679
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_set_binary_by_arch (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *arch)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_set_binary_by_arch (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *arch)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2682
msgid "Set the qemu binary name to C<qemu-system-[arch]>."
msgstr "Устанавливает имя исполняемого файла qemu в C<qemu-system-[arch]>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2684
msgid ""
"As a special case if C<arch> is C<NULL>, the binary is set to the KVM binary "
"for the current host architecture:"
msgstr ""
"В частном случае, если C<arch> равен C<NULL>, исполняемый файл "
"устанавливается в исполняемый файл KVM для текущей архитектуры хоста:"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2687
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" qemuopts_set_binary_by_arch (qopts, NULL);\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" qemuopts_set_binary_by_arch (qopts, NULL);\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2691
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_script>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_script>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2693
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_to_script (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *filename)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_to_script (struct qemuopts *qopts, const char *filename)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2696
msgid "Write the qemu options to a script."
msgstr "Записывает опции qemu в скрипт."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2698 docs/internal-documentation.pod:2726
msgid "C<qemuopts_set_binary*> must be called first."
msgstr "Сначала должен быть вызван C<qemuopts_set_binary*>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2700
msgid ""
"The script file will start with C<#!/bin/sh> and will be chmod to mode "
"C<0755>."
msgstr ""
"Файл скрипта будет начинаться с C<#!/bin/sh> и будет иметь режим chmod "
"C<0755>."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2705
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:shell_quote>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:shell_quote>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2707
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" static void\n"
" shell_quote (const char *str, FILE *fp)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" static void\n"
" shell_quote (const char *str, FILE *fp)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2710
msgid "Print C<str> to C<fp>, shell-quoting it if necessary."
msgstr "Печатает C<str> в C<fp>, экранируя для оболочки при необходимости."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2712
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:shell_and_comma_quote>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:shell_and_comma_quote>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2714
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" static void\n"
" shell_and_comma_quote (const char *str, FILE *fp)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" static void\n"
" shell_and_comma_quote (const char *str, FILE *fp)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2717
msgid "Print C<str> to C<fp> doing both shell and qemu comma quoting."
msgstr ""
"Печатает C<str> в C<fp>, выполняя как экранирование оболочки, так и "
"экранирование запятых qemu."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2719
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_channel>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_channel>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2721
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_to_channel (struct qemuopts *qopts, FILE *fp)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" qemuopts_to_channel (struct qemuopts *qopts, FILE *fp)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2724
msgid "Write the qemu options to a C<FILE *fp>."
msgstr "Записывает опции qemu в C<FILE *fp>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2728
msgid ""
"Only the qemu command line is written.  The caller may need to add C<#!/bin/"
"sh> and may need to chmod the resulting file to C<0755>."
msgstr ""
"Записывается только командная строка qemu.  Вызывающему может потребоваться "
"добавить C<#!/bin/sh> и изменить режим результирующего файла на C<0755>."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2733
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_argv>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_argv>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2735
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" char **\n"
" qemuopts_to_argv (struct qemuopts *qopts)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" char **\n"
" qemuopts_to_argv (struct qemuopts *qopts)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2738
msgid ""
"Return a NULL-terminated argument list, of the kind that can be passed "
"directly to L<execv(3)>."
msgstr ""
"Возвращает NULL-терминированный список аргументов того типа, который можно "
"напрямую передать в L<execv(3)>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2741
msgid ""
"C<qemuopts_set_binary*> must be called first.  It will be returned as "
"C<argv[0]> in the returned list."
msgstr ""
"Сначала должен быть вызван C<qemuopts_set_binary*>.  Он будет возвращён как "
"C<argv[0]> в возвращённом списке."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2744
msgid ""
"The list of strings and the strings themselves must be freed by the caller."
msgstr "Список строк и сами строки должны быть освобождены вызывающим."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:2749
msgid "Function C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_config_file>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/qemuopts/qemuopts.c:qemuopts_to_config_file>"

#. type: verbatim
