#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3065
msgid "Function C<common/utils/utils.c:guestfs_int_random_string>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/utils/utils.c:guestfs_int_random_string>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3067
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_int_random_string (char *ret, size_t len)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" int\n"
" guestfs_int_random_string (char *ret, size_t len)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3070
msgid "Return a random string of characters."
msgstr "Возвращает случайную строку символов."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3078
msgid ""
"The C<ret> buffer must have length C<len+1> in order to store the final "
"C<\\0> character."
msgstr ""
"Буфер C<ret> должен иметь длину C<len+1>, чтобы сохранить конечный символ "
"C<\\0>."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3083
msgid ""
"There is about 5 bits of randomness per output character (so about C<5*len> "
"bits of randomness in the resulting string)."
msgstr ""
"На каждый выходной символ приходится около 5 бит случайности (таким образом, "
"в результирующей строке около C<5*len> бит случайности)."

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3088
msgid "Function C<common/utils/utils.c:guestfs_int_drive_name>"
msgstr "Функция C<common/utils/utils.c:guestfs_int_drive_name>"

#. type: verbatim
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3090
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" char *\n"
" guestfs_int_drive_name (size_t index, char *ret)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" char *\n"
" guestfs_int_drive_name (size_t index, char *ret)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3093
msgid "This turns a drive index (eg. C<27>) into a drive name (eg. C<\"ab\">)."
msgstr ""
"Преобразует индекс диска (например, C<27>) в имя диска (например, C<\"ab\">)."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3096
msgid ""
"Drive indexes count from C<0>.  The return buffer has to be large enough for "
"the resulting string, and the returned pointer points to the *end* of the "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Индексы дисков считаются с C<0>.  Возвращаемый буфер должен быть достаточно "
"большим для результирующей строки, и возвращаемый указатель указывает на "
"*конец* строки."

#. type: textblock
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3100
msgid ""
"L<https://rwmj.wordpress.com/2011/01/09/how-are-linux-drives-named-beyond-"
"drive-26-devsdz/>"
msgstr ""
"L<https://rwmj.wordpress.com/2011/01/09/how-are-linux-drives-named-beyond-"
"drive-26-devsdz/>"

#. type: =head4
#: docs/internal-documentation.pod:3102
